  "sharedRegistration": "No direct registration/material/native operands in nine selected bodies. Existing feature-table identity is retained and its list is replaced; shared owners observe replacement. Its old dictionary is untouched here and may be stale until the retained pair-dictionary rebuild. Actual aliases, callbacks and BCL/native/logging effects unexecuted.",
  "partialState": "No handlers/rollback/lock. Logging precedes mutations. Conditional table creation, unconditional list replacement, ordered Add prefix, then legacy-list null followed by legacy-table null; failures may preserve each earlier mutation.",
  "keyBoundary": "No packed pair-key construction/dictionary insertion in this method. Retained caller later builds UInt32 (second<<16)|first, first duplicate computed key wins; no mask or range guard. No observed game indices or collisions."
